WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.334 --> 00:00:02.769
-Robert and I have
a lot of history together.

00:00:02.769 --> 00:00:05.538
Not a lot of people know this,
but back in the early '90s,

00:00:05.538 --> 00:00:06.872
we both starred in a commercial

00:00:06.872 --> 00:00:10.176
for an allergy medicine
called Zynerma.

00:00:10.176 --> 00:00:12.211
-Oh, my -- That's totally right.
-Remember that?

00:00:12.211 --> 00:00:14.514
-Yeah, that
really eccentric director.

00:00:14.514 --> 00:00:16.249
-Oh, don't even. The director.

00:00:16.249 --> 00:00:18.318
-He came out of French cinema,

00:00:18.318 --> 00:00:19.419
right?
-He did.

00:00:19.419 --> 00:00:21.854
Well, he had this thing
that he wanted us

00:00:21.854 --> 00:00:23.656
to have our line readings
be really fresh.

00:00:23.656 --> 00:00:26.259
Right, so he didn't want us to
see our lines before the bit.

00:00:26.259 --> 00:00:27.727
-That's right.
-So every time

00:00:27.727 --> 00:00:29.929
we went to the commercial,
we were reading the lines

00:00:29.929 --> 00:00:31.664
for the first time
right there on set.

00:00:31.664 --> 00:00:33.099
Well, I found one
of our old commercials.

00:00:33.099 --> 00:00:34.400
-No!
-Yes.

00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:36.402
-Oh, it's about time.
-So, here for the first time

00:00:36.402 --> 00:00:39.205
in decades is me
and Robert Downey Jr.'s ad

00:00:39.205 --> 00:00:41.207
for Zynerma.
-Zynerma!

00:00:41.207 --> 00:00:43.610
-If you suffer
from seasonal allergies,

00:00:43.610 --> 00:00:47.414
then relief is finally here
with once-daily Zynerma.

00:00:47.414 --> 00:00:52.285
Ask your doctor or pharmacist
if Zynerma is right for you.

00:00:52.285 --> 00:00:53.586
-Before Zynerma,

00:00:53.586 --> 00:00:55.922
my allergies would keep me
in bed all day long.

00:00:55.922 --> 00:00:57.056
But not anymore.

00:00:57.056 --> 00:00:58.558
Now the only thing
keeping in my bed

00:00:58.558 --> 00:01:00.126
is my fear of tall men.

00:01:00.126 --> 00:01:03.396
[ Laughter ]

00:01:03.396 --> 00:01:07.567
-Side effects of Zynerma
may include thought blisters,

00:01:07.567 --> 00:01:13.039
the mumps, hepatitis K,
gooberlycosis,

00:01:13.039 --> 00:01:18.477
tripolar depression and slacks,
premature fatherhood,

00:01:18.477 --> 00:01:23.649
stump lung, crispicks,
and hat failure.

00:01:23.649 --> 00:01:26.786
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:26.786 --> 00:01:30.823
-Best of all, they're shaped
like Flintstone characters.

00:01:30.823 --> 00:01:32.525
Not the pills. My nipples.

00:01:32.525 --> 00:01:35.761
♪♪

00:01:35.761 --> 00:01:38.898
-Zynerma shouldn't replace
your asthma inhaler,

00:01:38.898 --> 00:01:42.635
and it can't replace...her.

00:01:42.635 --> 00:01:46.105
Sorry, big guy,
but she's not coming back.

00:01:46.105 --> 00:01:49.575
The sooner you accept that, the
better off we're all gonna be.

00:01:49.575 --> 00:01:53.513
♪♪

00:01:53.513 --> 00:01:55.748
She actually wrote you
a really long letter

00:01:55.748 --> 00:01:57.416
explaining everything,

00:01:57.416 --> 00:02:00.520
but I accidentally
dropped it in the toilet.

00:02:00.520 --> 00:02:01.788
My bad.

00:02:01.788 --> 00:02:03.857
-Alright, now me and you
together.

00:02:03.857 --> 00:02:04.790
-Okay.

00:02:04.790 --> 00:02:07.426
♪♪

00:02:07.426 --> 00:02:09.028
-Wait, give me a second.

00:02:09.028 --> 00:02:10.329
[ Laughter ]

00:02:10.329 --> 00:02:12.398
Alright, ready?

00:02:12.398 --> 00:02:14.267
Zynerma let me live again,

00:02:14.267 --> 00:02:18.270
because I was once declared
legally dead for 15 hours.

00:02:18.270 --> 00:02:21.007
-If your erection lasts
more than four hours,

00:02:21.007 --> 00:02:23.375
that has nothing to do
with Zynerma...

00:02:23.375 --> 00:02:25.678
but congratulations.

00:02:25.678 --> 00:02:27.713
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:27.713 --> 00:02:29.482
♪♪

00:02:29.482 --> 00:02:33.319
-What the...?
There's more?

00:02:33.319 --> 00:02:34.687
Alright.

00:02:34.687 --> 00:02:39.125
One time, I got a Lego man
stuck in my no--

00:02:39.125 --> 00:02:40.993
[ Laughter ]

00:02:40.993 --> 00:02:44.196
One time, I got a Lego man
stuck in my nose.

00:02:44.196 --> 00:02:47.233
I blew and blew and blew,
but he wouldn't come out.

00:02:47.233 --> 00:02:49.134
He's still up there to this day.

00:02:49.134 --> 00:02:51.737
Sometimes when I'm lying in bed
at night, I think about him --

00:02:51.737 --> 00:02:55.474
how old he is,
if he ever got married,

00:02:55.474 --> 00:02:57.176
if he's happy.

00:02:57.176 --> 00:02:58.544
Then the Ambien kicks in

00:02:58.544 --> 00:03:00.546
and I fall asleep
naked in the front yard.

00:03:00.546 --> 00:03:03.483
♪♪

00:03:03.483 --> 00:03:05.885
-Whoa, I just
r-realized something.

00:03:05.885 --> 00:03:08.254
Zynerma rhymes with potato.

00:03:08.254 --> 00:03:09.822
Wait, no. Sorry.

00:03:09.822 --> 00:03:12.158
Tomato rhymes with "pot-ah-to."

00:03:12.158 --> 00:03:15.661
Damn it, I just
embarrassed myself again.

00:03:15.661 --> 00:03:17.630
I guess my dry cleaner
was right --

00:03:17.630 --> 00:03:20.232
I'm a worthless sack of crap.

00:03:20.232 --> 00:03:23.636
♪♪

00:03:23.636 --> 00:03:27.373
[ Laughter ]

00:03:27.373 --> 00:03:30.109
-Hey, Tad. Hey, Tad.
What are you up to, man?

00:03:30.109 --> 00:03:32.145
-Hey, sorry, bro.

00:03:32.145 --> 00:03:34.647
-[ Laughs ]

00:03:34.647 --> 00:03:36.582
You know you can make --

00:03:36.582 --> 00:03:39.318
Do you know you can make
your own homemade Tylenol?

00:03:39.318 --> 00:03:41.521
All you need is Skittles
and vodka.

00:03:41.521 --> 00:03:44.624
[ Laughter ]

00:03:44.624 --> 00:03:47.092
-Ask your doctor
about Zynerma today,

00:03:47.092 --> 00:03:49.661
then ask your doctor
for their number.

00:03:49.661 --> 00:03:51.664
Doctors are good people to date

00:03:51.664 --> 00:03:53.465
because they've already
seen you naked

00:03:53.465 --> 00:03:55.835
and most of them
make a [bleep]load of money.

00:03:55.835 --> 00:03:58.471
[ Laughter ]

00:03:58.471 --> 00:04:01.073
-I asked my doctor if Zynerma
was right for me,

00:04:01.073 --> 00:04:03.776
but he said, "I've never heard
of Zynerma. What is it?"

00:04:03.776 --> 00:04:05.378
So I said, "It's a pill,
dum-dum.

00:04:05.378 --> 00:04:06.979
Just write the prescription."

00:04:06.979 --> 00:04:09.181
Then he said, "That's not
how prescriptions work."

00:04:09.181 --> 00:04:11.683
So I said, "Pwease?"
And he said, "No."

00:04:11.683 --> 00:04:13.553
So I said,
"Pwetty, pwetty pwease?"

00:04:13.553 --> 00:04:15.922
And he said no again
and called the police.

00:04:15.922 --> 00:04:18.124
So now I go to the veterinarian.

00:04:18.124 --> 00:04:20.026
[ Laughter ]

00:04:20.026 --> 00:04:22.194
♪♪

00:04:22.194 --> 00:04:24.630
-Here's a list of
everything I'm allergic to --

00:04:24.630 --> 00:04:25.898
love...

00:04:25.898 --> 00:04:29.735
[ Laughter ]

00:04:29.735 --> 00:04:36.575
♪♪

00:04:36.575 --> 00:04:39.678
-I lived in the back of
a Walgreens for three years

00:04:39.678 --> 00:04:42.781
because my arm was stuck
in the blood pressure machine.

00:04:42.781 --> 00:04:44.350
-That's where I found him.

00:04:44.350 --> 00:04:46.752
I took him home,
hosed him off in his yard

00:04:46.752 --> 00:04:49.489
and nursed him back to health
with Muscle Milk.

00:04:49.489 --> 00:04:51.990
-Soon, I weighed 600 pounds.

00:04:51.990 --> 00:04:53.993
It was a long, hard road
to lose all that weight,

00:04:53.993 --> 00:04:56.328
and I couldn't have done it
without a good friend.

00:04:56.328 --> 00:05:00.399
-But after his friend escaped,
I stepped in.

00:05:00.399 --> 00:05:03.369
The rest is
rock 'n' roll history.

00:05:03.369 --> 00:05:05.204
-Thanks, Zynerma!
-Thanks, Zynerma!

00:05:05.204 --> 00:05:07.373
[ Cheers and applause ]
-Once-daily Zynerma --

00:05:07.373 --> 00:05:09.275
breathe deep.

00:05:09.275 --> 00:05:11.944
♪♪

00:05:11.944 --> 00:05:14.547
-Had a lot of...
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:14.547 --> 00:05:17.817
You got a lot of -- [ Laughs ]
-That went on a bit.

00:05:17.817 --> 00:05:19.785
-We did a lot of commercials.

00:05:19.785 --> 00:05:21.720
I forgot how many commercials
we ended up doing.

00:05:21.720 --> 00:05:23.589
-Yeah. Very experimental.
-[ Laughs ]

00:05:23.589 --> 00:05:25.892
My thanks to Robert Downey Jr.,
everybody.

